# Forge: local secrets only. Copy to `.env` and do not commit `.env`.
#
# ── Modular Cloud API key ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Forge calls Modular Cloud models through Goose. You need a personal API key.
#
# 1. Sign in to Modular Cloud (build.modular.com).
# 2. Open Settings → API keys.
# 3. Create a key and paste it on the line below.
#
# Model access and billing follow your Modular Cloud account.
#
# Alternate env name (same value):
#   MODULAR_CLOUD_API_KEY=
#
MODULAR_API_KEY=
